  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fiscal consolidation program for Rio Grande del Sur</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de consolidacion fiscal para Rio Grande del Sur</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Component I. Fiscal management strengthening. This component aims at strenghtening local tax revenues as well as improving the public finances balance to reduce the fiscal deficit in a sustainable manner. Component II. Quality of expenditure. This component aims to strenghten the government&apos;s capacity to manage its expenditures in a more efficient and transparent manner. Component III. Public investment. this component will strengthen the government&apos;s capacity to manage its public investments, including the institutional framework for planning, evaluation and execution of investment programs.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
